sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant KServeHF as KServe Gateway<br/>(HuggingFace)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Model as Local Model<br/>(MODEL_DIR)
    participant KServeJudge as KServe Gateway<br/>(LLM Judge)
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant VLLM as vLLM Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Orch,BuiltIn: Flow 1: Built-in Text Detection (regex PII, file-type, custom)
        Orch->>BuiltIn: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>HTTP, No Auth
        BuiltIn->>BuiltIn: Run selected detectors<br/>(regex PII, file-type, custom)
        BuiltIn-->>Orch: Detection results<br/>(detections array)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Orch,Model: Flow 2: HuggingFace Model-based Detection
        Orch->>KServeHF: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Platform TLS (Istio), Platform Auth
        KServeHF->>HF: Forward request<br/>mTLS (Istio sidecar)
        HF->>Model: Load/inference<br/>Filesystem access
        Model-->>HF: Predictions<br/>(sequence/token/causal)
        HF-->>KServeHF: Detection results
        KServeHF-->>Orch: Response<br/>Platform TLS
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Orch,VLLM: Flow 3: LLM-as-a-Judge Evaluation
        Orch->>KServeJudge: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Platform TLS (Istio), Platform Auth
        KServeJudge->>Judge: Forward request<br/>mTLS (Istio sidecar)
        Judge->>VLLM: Async HTTP evaluation<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP, No Auth
        VLLM-->>Judge: LLM judgment response
        Judge-->>KServeJudge: Detection results
        KServeJudge-->>Orch: Response<br/>Platform TLS
    end
